ern)` (lookahead):** Checks that the line contains an IPv4 address with word boundaries (not preceded/followed by alphanumeric characters)\n\n2. **`.*?` (non-greedy):** Matches characters up to a date, finding the rightmost match due to the negative lookahead\n\n3. **`(?<![A-Za-z0-9])(date_capture)(?![A-Za-z0-9])`:** Captures the date with word boundary enforcement\n\n4. **`(?!.*date_pattern)` (negative lookahead):** Ensures no additional dates follow this one on the line\n\n5. **`.*$`:** Matches to the end of the line\n\nThe pattern correctly:\n- Rejects dates like \"1134-12-1234\" (invalid month/day) and \"2024-02-30\" (invalid day for February)\n- Requires valid dates: Jan-Dec have proper day ranges, Feb accepts 01-29\n- Enforces word boundaries to avoid matching embedded numbers like in \"user1134-12-12user\"\n- Returns only the last date in lines with multiple dates","ttft_ms":119804,"type":"result","duration_ms":123987,"uuid":"b43f82e3-3d97-4c49-b6ec-4c1a387a6e2e","ttft_stream_ms":1070,"time_to_request_ms":82,"queued_turn_count":0}
